              <strong>{selectedDateHoliday.name}</strong> ({selectedDateHoliday.startDate} - {selectedDateHoliday.endDate})
            </p>
            <p className="text-sm mt-2 text-red-600">
              ─É├óy l├á ng├áy nghß╗ë ─æ├ú ─æ╞░ß╗úc ─æ─âng k├╜. Kh├┤ng thß╗â l╞░u ─æiß╗âm danh cho ng├áy n├áy.
            </p>
            <p className="text-sm mt-1 text-red-600">
              Nß║┐u c├│ bß║ún ghi c┼⌐, lß╗ïch sß╗¡ ─æiß╗âm danh sß║╜ hiß╗ân thß╗ï trß║íng th├íi "Lß╗èCH NGHß╗ê CHUNG".
            </p>
          </div>
